<div class="page-header"><h2>Eliminar producto</h2></div>
<div class="brand-card p-4 mx-auto" style="max-width: 480px">
  <p>¿Está seguro que desea eliminar el producto <strong>{{product.name}}</strong>?</p>
  <form action="/commerce/products/{{product._id}}/delete" method="POST" class="d-flex gap-2">
    <a href="/commerce/products" class="btn btn-ghost flex-fill">Cancelar</a>
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-brand flex-fill"><i class="bi bi-trash"></i> Aceptar</button>
  </form>
</div>
